{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18304","headline":"嘲鼾睡 二 · 韩愈","name":"嘲鼾睡 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澹公坐卧时，长睡无不稳。\n吾尝闻其声，深虑五藏损。\n黄河弄濆薄，梗涩连拙鮌。\n南帝初旧槌，凿窍泄混沌。\n迥然忽长引，万丈不可忖。\n谓言绝於斯，继出方衮衮。\n幽幽寸喉中，草木森苯䔿。\n盗贼虽狡狯，亡魂敢窥阃。\n鸿蒙总合杂，诡谲骋戾很。\n乍如鬬呶呶，忽若怨恳恳。\n赋形苦不同，无路寻根本。\n何能堙其源，惟有土一畚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}